# inc-k0e1: wizard-summon a goblin directly east of the player, then attack east.
# The probe (INCURSION_CLEAVE_ILLUSION_PROBE) gives the player Cleave, spawns a real
# bugbear beside the player, holds the goblin at 1 HP and, in illusion mode, makes it
# an illusion.
# The character is LOADED (INCURSION_LOAD, set by tools/check_cleave_illusion.sh), not
# generated: tools/fixtures/chars/orc-barbarian-seed1-opt0822.sav.
@until "Things in View" ESC

w
y
@choose "Genocide Everything"
SPACE*40                 # dismiss the genocide message chain; the summoned goblin is then the only monster

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT ENTER
RIGHT
.*2
RIGHT
.*2
RIGHT
.*2
@dump:end
